    {
      "name": "board-secure-rom",
      "group": "boot-rom",
      "role": "Secure boot ROM (addresses 0x0-0x10fff) copied from the board over USB FEL; thirteen words in its first 1 KiB differ from the published FIXS-BROM",
      "acquisition": "board",
      "url": null,
      "revision": "board capture 2026-10-16, USB port 3-1",
      "sha256": "a8e31821e8a1611d75867825914c58373c732742cb8f2235e8168c1d7e93b5aa",
      "bytes": 69632,
      "cache_path": "evidence/rom-copy-20261016-084055/physical-rom.bin",
      "used_by": [
        "checks/a733-rom-recovery.py",
        "checks/remote-writers-sources.py",
        "checks/watchdog-rom-reset-log.py",
        "tools/check-a733-smp.py",
        "tools/check-fel-input.py",
        "tools/check-watchdog-configuration.py",
        "tools/check-watchdog-expiry.py",
        "docs/watchdog.md",
        "docs/usb-platform.md",
        "docs/video-platform.md",
        "apps/usb-returning/README.md"
      ],
      "analysis": "boot-rom-and-boot0.md",
      "tool": {
        "name": "sunxi-fel built by tools/build-sunxi-fel.py from the sunxi-tools entry in sources.lock.json with the four A733 patches",
        "sha256": "4a54cdc179baafbdecac47eb85714c3745d6d9952e05b482c7016afd4b22bf3e"
      },
      "procedure": [
        "Only the board coordinator runs these steps, under the board lock of tools/usb-access.py, on a board in USB FEL mode. FEL is the boot ROM's USB recovery protocol. A direct FEL read of address 0 is refused, so the copy runs on the board CPU through SRAM.",
        "Let DEV be the bus:device pair of the board, for example 3:64.",
        "Save the helper workspace and the copy buffer: sunxi-fel -d DEV read 0x71000 128 scratch.bin read 0x52000 1024 buffer.bin",
        "Copy the first 1 KiB of ROM into SRAM and read it: sunxi-fel -d DEV memmove 0x52000 0x0 1024 read 0x52000 1024 rom-prefix.bin",
        "Restore both areas: sunxi-fel -d DEV write 0x52000 buffer.bin write 0x71000 scratch.bin, then read them back and compare with the saved files.",
        "Repeat the save, copy and restore for the remainder with a 68608-byte buffer: memmove 0x52000 0x400 68608, then read 0x52000 68608 rom-remainder.bin.",
        "Concatenate rom-prefix.bin and rom-remainder.bin into physical-rom.bin (69632 bytes) and compare its SHA-256 with this entry. No reset is needed."
      ]
    },
